From: Mikhail Mlhcnn <mikhail@advnirr.org>
Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 027] panfrost: add the missing v11 cases to the arch switches

Purpose: add missing v11 cases to panfrost arch switches
Source/Reference: upstream Mesa commit c9c207bfd3d (author preserved)
Backport-of: c9c207bfd3d
Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC6 (0xb8a31030, PAN_ARCH 11)
Tested Kbase UAPI: 1.21
Mesa base range: 5a07217f034b3e50d8c7c7794f97a2df1742613b
Dependencies: csf-v11/026
Validation test: device matrix as 026

diff --git a/src/panfrost/genxml/decode_common.c b/src/panfrost/genxml/decode_common.c
index d09ea21560527fc592257876babecb892c7c50d5..96ee55b0e8c77aa1c0517ed4b63efee7aca3f14b 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/genxml/decode_common.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/genxml/decode_common.c
@@ -446,6 +446,9 @@ pandecode_cs_binary(struct pandecode_context *ctx, uint64_t bin_gpu_va,
    case 10:
       pandecode_cs_binary_v10(ctx, bin_gpu_va, size);
       break;
+   case 11:
+      pandecode_cs_binary_v11(ctx, bin_gpu_va, size);
+      break;
    case 12:
       pandecode_cs_binary_v12(ctx, bin_gpu_va, size);
       break;
@@ -472,6 +475,9 @@ pandecode_cs_trace(struct pandecode_context *ctx, uint64_t trace_gpu_va,
    case 10:
       pandecode_cs_trace_v10(ctx, trace_gpu_va, size, gpu_id);
       break;
+   case 11:
+      pandecode_cs_trace_v11(ctx, trace_gpu_va, size, gpu_id);
+      break;
    case 12:
       pandecode_cs_trace_v12(ctx, trace_gpu_va, size, gpu_id);
       break;
